    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City Turn is a colourful 2D singleplayer, turn-based game.\u00a0Purple player is the program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automated player is not AI generated; it's an algorithm</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings are stored differently for each game on a game load.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the replay buildings would be in the same place, but images to find and their location would be different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is competing against a program (AI) in finding the same 5 images. There is 'Play in Order' mode in which 5 images should be found in order.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is 8x8 board of buildings and there is a map showing  player's positions. Tip on the map is showing where the closest image might be, it's not guaranteed to be there as the game wouldn't have a point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player can win/loose points and be hit by the various objects, there are some coming out from the buildings too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If not actively playing the ramp will appear.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 10 different buildings: caffes, market, hotel, gallery...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idea is to memorise which and where image was found by you or another player. Instead of timer there's another player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080410/extras/65d17441a01f88935e2b51c65b062c80.poster.avif?t=1752698603\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080410/extras/65d17441a01f88935e2b51c65b062c80.webm?t=1752698603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080410/extras/65d17441a01f88935e2b51c65b062c80.mp4?t=1752698603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City Turn is a colourful 2D singleplayer, turn-based game.\u00a0Purple player is the program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automated player is not AI generated; it's an algorithm</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings are stored differently for each game on a game load.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the replay buildings would be in the same place, but images to find and their location would be different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is competing against a program (AI) in finding the same 5 images. There is 'Play in Order' mode in which 5 images should be found in order.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is 8x8 board of buildings and there is a map showing  player's positions. Tip on the map is showing where the closest image might be, it's not guaranteed to be there as the game wouldn't have a point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player can win/loose points and be hit by the various objects, there are some coming out from the buildings too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If not actively playing the ramp will appear.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 10 different buildings: caffes, market, hotel, gallery...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idea is to memorise which and where image was found by you or another player. Instead of timer there's another player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080410/extras/65d17441a01f88935e2b51c65b062c80.poster.avif?t=1752698603\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080410/extras/65d17441a01f88935e2b51c65b062c80.webm?t=1752698603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080410/extras/65d17441a01f88935e2b51c65b062c80.mp4?t=1752698603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "City Turn is a colourful 2D singleplayer, turn based game. The player is competing against a program in finding the same 5 images in the given or in any order. Player can win/loose points and be hit by the objects. Buildings are stored differently for each game on loading game.",
